WEBVTT

00:02.440 --> 00:06.690
You know... You really messed up this time.

00:07.140 --> 00:12.040
Dad's still pissed. You're honestly lucky 
this is the extent of your punishment.

00:13.840 --> 00:16.070
I'm sorry, Onee-chan...

01:51.090 --> 01:57.050
<b>#3 "They Show Up When You Least Expect It"</b>

01:58.260 --> 02:00.220
<b>Tanisaki Bread</b>

01:58.260 --> 02:01.200
Yes, thank you very much.

02:01.200 --> 02:05.270
Hey, those two girls were first. 
I was watching.

02:09.090 --> 02:09.980
<i>Yoshino!</i>

02:09.980 --> 02:11.940
<i>Y-Yes, Aki-sama?</i>

02:11.940 --> 02:15.920
I need you to add five rice balls 
to that order of breads.

02:15.920 --> 02:17.400
<i>All right.</i>

02:26.080 --> 02:27.300
Honestly...

02:27.720 --> 02:30.040
What's everyone's problem?!

02:30.440 --> 02:32.820
First comes muscles...

02:33.730 --> 02:36.260
Second comes muscles...

02:36.260 --> 02:39.720
There's no third or fourth...

02:39.720 --> 02:42.170
Fifth comes muscles...

02:48.310 --> 02:50.500
M-Master?

02:48.310 --> 02:51.270
<b>Deodorizing
Mist</b>

02:48.310 --> 02:51.270
<b>Unscented</b>

02:52.130 --> 02:54.480
I'm surprised you knew I was here.

02:54.480 --> 02:57.180
The student store is right below here.

02:57.180 --> 02:59.850
I thought I heard some creepy yelling.

02:59.850 --> 03:01.580
Don't say it's creepy.

03:01.580 --> 03:04.830
Running away to your muscles 
isn't going to change Aki-sama.

03:07.330 --> 03:11.330
<b>Salmon</b>

03:07.660 --> 03:11.330
But seriously, that's so much food.

03:11.630 --> 03:14.060
She's been eating more again as of late.

03:14.060 --> 03:16.250
She hasn't changed?

03:16.700 --> 03:19.300
Basically, no. But she's 
gotten a little sloppier.

03:19.300 --> 03:21.260
Oh... I see.

03:27.060 --> 03:32.310
Damn it! How is she able to 
twist the truth so much?

03:33.140 --> 03:36.860
You don't have any idea, 
either, right? It's insane.

03:38.670 --> 03:43.990
Aki-sama was going through a lot back then... 
So she might be confused.

03:43.990 --> 03:47.930
So she conveniently manipulated 
her memories for her own sake.

03:48.580 --> 03:51.390
Well, anyway, Aki-sama's starving.

03:51.390 --> 03:55.420
Pig's Foot, I'll try to smooth 
things over with Aki-sama, too.

03:55.420 --> 03:59.050
You're the best, Master! 
You're truly the only one I can rely on.

04:00.320 --> 04:02.740
I might not be able to do much, though.

04:03.870 --> 04:04.730
Huh?

04:06.830 --> 04:08.980
<i>It's not like her to say that.</i>

04:09.470 --> 04:13.160
Can't you wait a little longer on the payment?

04:13.160 --> 04:15.480
This is no time to show off.

04:16.840 --> 04:19.070
All right. I'll figure it out.

04:24.490 --> 04:26.390
Well, you seem busy.

04:27.710 --> 04:30.560
I heard you got quite the scolding at home.

04:30.560 --> 04:32.410
Must be hard being a traitor.

04:32.780 --> 04:34.370
It doesn't concern you.

04:34.370 --> 04:39.580
Well, that's not true. 
I'm your master's fiancé, after all.

04:46.510 --> 04:48.220
I'm sorry, Adagaki-san!

04:48.220 --> 04:50.960
I was wrong about everything!

04:50.960 --> 04:54.060
Even if you're trying to fabricate everything 
and act like the tragic heroine,

04:54.520 --> 04:56.520
I still love you!

04:56.520 --> 05:00.610
Makabe... You'll still love me if I'm fake?

05:00.610 --> 05:05.300
Yes! Putting a lid on our problems! 
That's just the right thing to do!

05:06.070 --> 05:08.530
Thank you, Makabe!

05:13.050 --> 05:14.710
Are you okay, Makabe-kun?!

05:14.710 --> 05:20.170
<i>It's no use. Even if there was a way out 
of this stalemate, I don't think I'd last.</i>

05:20.950 --> 05:23.080
Did you hit your head?

05:26.330 --> 05:28.430
Uh, no... I'm fine.

05:29.300 --> 05:31.140
You seem rather tired.

05:31.470 --> 05:34.220
Er, yeah... a little bit.

05:34.670 --> 05:38.250
Say, Masamune-sama. 
Do you have some time after school?

05:38.250 --> 05:39.100
Huh?

05:39.500 --> 05:42.070
There's somewhere I'd like to go with you.

05:50.290 --> 05:51.700
Sorry to keep you waiting.

05:52.170 --> 05:54.000
Are you okay?

05:54.000 --> 05:57.180
Yes. It's just a follow-up.

05:58.680 --> 06:02.250
When you asked me to come with you, 
this wasn't what I expected.

06:02.250 --> 06:05.440
Well, Shidou isn't here today.

06:05.440 --> 06:08.430
Yes, yes, I'll take her place today.

06:08.810 --> 06:11.680
Did you think we'd go somewhere 
more fitting for a rendezvous?

06:11.680 --> 06:13.610
Wha— I just—

06:13.610 --> 06:15.080
Why don't we take a little walk?

06:17.890 --> 06:21.640
Moderate exercise and saying 
everything you're thinking

06:21.640 --> 06:24.250
are both very important to your health.

06:27.320 --> 06:30.320
I see... So that's what happened in Paris.

06:30.670 --> 06:34.540
I'm sure it's my fault for not being able 
to hold back and going off on her...

06:34.540 --> 06:38.220
I did think things seemed 
a bit different than usual,

06:38.220 --> 06:40.960
but that is quite worrisome.

06:40.960 --> 06:45.710
It is! It's putting my whole 
revenge plan in jeopardy.

06:47.890 --> 06:51.720
You still haven't given up on this revenge?

06:52.170 --> 06:53.180
Huh?

06:53.500 --> 06:55.890
Do you want Aki-sama to fall in love with you?

06:56.520 --> 06:58.850
Well... yeah.

06:58.850 --> 07:02.860
Even though you loathe her 
and she makes you sick?

07:03.940 --> 07:06.920
Th-That's exactly why I'm going to dump her.

07:06.920 --> 07:09.070
That'll be my revenge, after all.

07:12.740 --> 07:16.490
That's not what you'd call love anymore.

07:16.490 --> 07:19.120
What the heck? Of course it's not.

07:25.200 --> 07:27.000
What's... going on?

07:27.420 --> 07:29.970
I thought I'd be a little courageous.

07:30.660 --> 07:33.120
You're going to choose Adagaki Aki.

07:33.120 --> 07:37.180
But that's for the sake of revenge, not love.

07:37.180 --> 07:42.350
Which would mean that if we fell in love, 
you wouldn't be cheating on her.

07:42.350 --> 07:43.700
Fujinomiya-san...

07:45.040 --> 07:46.980
Masamune-sama, I...

07:48.760 --> 07:49.930
Let's run.

07:49.930 --> 07:50.570
Huh?

07:51.880 --> 07:53.690
What in the world is going on?

08:01.000 --> 08:02.540
I'm finally here, Aki-chan.

08:02.880 --> 08:06.250
Sorry, one of the teachers 
asked me to do something,

08:06.720 --> 08:09.400
and it took longer than I expected.

08:10.480 --> 08:12.620
No, it's totally fine.

08:12.620 --> 08:14.040
I know, Aki-chan!

08:14.040 --> 08:16.940
Why don't we stop by a family restaurant 
on our way home to eat something sweet?

08:16.940 --> 08:19.450
I heard there's some new dessert.

08:19.450 --> 08:22.800
Oh, really? Let's go, then.

08:22.800 --> 08:24.060
You don't mind, right, Yoshino?

08:24.400 --> 08:31.070
Aki-sama, I'm terribly sorry, 
but I'd like to head back to the mansion.

08:31.480 --> 08:33.030
Oh, okay...

08:45.160 --> 08:47.500
I wonder what's wrong with Yoshino.

08:47.500 --> 08:49.530
Well, we should get going.

08:49.530 --> 08:51.710
Just a dang minute!

09:03.570 --> 09:09.180
Wh-What's going on, Masamune-sama?

09:09.180 --> 09:11.000
Who are those people?

09:11.000 --> 09:14.820
That's Muriel's big brother. 
You know, that girl I met in Paris.

09:15.240 --> 09:19.830
<i>Shit, shit, shit! This definitely has to do 
with our teaching Muriel about rom-coms!</i>

09:25.130 --> 09:27.960
That's as far as you're gonna go, guy.

09:28.880 --> 09:32.730
Masamune-sama, I'll throw up 
some blood to cause a diversion.

09:32.730 --> 09:35.610
I don't think that'll work 
now that you're healthy.

09:35.610 --> 09:38.320
My body has become quite inconvenient.

09:38.320 --> 09:39.800
Don't seem so sad about that.

09:41.260 --> 09:44.980
Where are you trying to 
run off to, Chikuwa-kun?

09:44.980 --> 09:48.220
I heard you took good care 
of my sister the other day.

09:48.220 --> 09:50.640
Nah, you didn't take care of her at all!

09:50.640 --> 09:53.650
Because you ran off in the middle 
of it and went back to Japan!

09:53.650 --> 09:55.660
I had a good reason for that!

09:55.660 --> 09:58.200
Non! I don't want to hear any excuses.

09:58.200 --> 09:59.700
<i>A gun?!</i>

10:03.250 --> 10:04.120
Huh?

10:04.120 --> 10:08.000
If it was up to me, I'd happily
fill you with lead, but alas...

10:12.050 --> 10:14.500
Muriel's manuscript?

10:14.500 --> 10:19.890
After you two left Paris, 
my sister kept drawing this.

10:19.890 --> 10:23.160
Even at the expense of eating and sleeping!

10:23.810 --> 10:26.860
Actually, she's gotten a lot better...

10:26.860 --> 10:30.790
I'm assuming she got some 
inspiration after seeing you two.

10:31.770 --> 10:36.300
And whatever that inspiration was is why 
I'm letting you off the hook just this once.

10:36.300 --> 10:37.240
Um—

10:38.630 --> 10:42.950
I'll just say this. I also prefer happy endings.

10:43.570 --> 10:45.910
Because reality is an absolute shithole.

10:48.920 --> 10:51.400
May I take a look, as well?

10:51.400 --> 10:53.210
S-Sure...

10:58.180 --> 11:01.260
You look awful. Wipe off your face.

11:07.450 --> 11:10.600
My parents are separating.

11:14.620 --> 11:16.360
This time, it's my turn.

11:16.870 --> 11:21.070
I'm gonna keep supporting you 
so you can cheer up.

11:21.390 --> 11:25.530
Thank you, but I'm going to go with my dad.

11:25.530 --> 11:28.400
Even then, our hearts will always be together.

11:28.400 --> 11:30.250
Let's see each other again when we're older.

11:42.180 --> 11:45.140
You look awful. Wipe off your face.

11:45.550 --> 11:47.560
I'm surprised you knew it was me.

11:47.560 --> 11:51.710
There's no way I wouldn't be able to tell. 
You'll always be you.

11:53.850 --> 11:55.810
<b>The End.</b>

11:56.160 --> 11:58.410
What a cute little story.

11:58.410 --> 12:00.280
Yeah... I guess.

12:00.950 --> 12:03.850
<i>Why didn't we end up like this?</i>

12:03.850 --> 12:07.240
<i>We ended up at odds with each other, 
hating and hating back...</i>

12:08.480 --> 12:11.260
Masamune-sama, there's a letter.

12:17.630 --> 12:19.640
<i>Bonjour, Masamune!</i>

12:19.640 --> 12:22.060
<i>I hope you have been well, I do!</i>

12:22.060 --> 12:25.760
<i>I drew a manga inspired by you and Aki.</i>

12:25.760 --> 12:29.640
<i>You never told me how everything ended, 
so I gave it my own original ending.</i>

12:29.640 --> 12:36.220
<i>I wish I could become a wall in your 
room and learn even more about you.</i>

12:38.000 --> 12:40.800
<i>The walls have ears, and the doors have eyes.</i>

12:40.800 --> 12:43.160
<i>Yours truly, Muriel Besson.</i>

12:43.570 --> 12:46.900
Walls? There's gotta be 
a better way to say that...

12:47.720 --> 12:49.210
Let me see that real quick.

12:49.210 --> 12:50.620
Masamune-sama?

12:51.040 --> 12:54.330
<i>This story started out happy,</i>

12:54.720 --> 12:58.040
<i>but in reality, it never got a happy ending.</i>

12:58.570 --> 13:00.520
<i>But if I look at it from 
a different perspective...</i>

13:01.340 --> 13:04.630
<i>Is that what's going on here?</i>

13:15.190 --> 13:17.190
<b>The End.</b>

13:23.030 --> 13:24.570
Onii-chan, you're the worst!

13:24.570 --> 13:27.320
My... My spine...

13:27.320 --> 13:29.870
You went into my room without 
permission again, didn't you?!

13:29.870 --> 13:32.760
And give me back the panties 
and socks you stole the other day!

13:32.760 --> 13:34.830
Huh?! What the hell are you talking about?!

13:34.830 --> 13:38.960
When I looked up at the second floor 
from outside, I saw you in my room!

13:39.920 --> 13:41.260
Why from outside?

13:41.260 --> 13:42.940
Because I went to the convenience store.

13:42.940 --> 13:46.170
Hey, are you eating 
junk food before dinner again?

13:46.170 --> 13:48.110
The hag's gonna yell at you again.

13:48.110 --> 13:49.470
Don't change the subject!

13:49.820 --> 13:51.070
Ugh, I've had enough!

13:51.070 --> 13:53.040
My brother wears his little sister's 
panties on his head!

13:53.040 --> 13:56.230
And he wears just one of his little sister's 
socks and stretches it way out!

13:56.230 --> 14:00.360
You're the absolute worse! Keep your 
perversion limited to your muscles only!

14:00.360 --> 14:02.440
Now, hang on! My muscles 
are absolutely innocent here!

14:02.440 --> 14:04.620
What's the matter, you two?

14:04.620 --> 14:07.960
Huh? Mom, were you just upstairs?

14:07.960 --> 14:13.290
Yes. I was taking you kids' 
laundry up to your rooms.

14:13.290 --> 14:15.930
Chinatsu...

14:15.930 --> 14:20.170
H-Huh? Maybe it was just my imagination.

14:20.170 --> 14:22.790
Oh, I know. Want some ice cream, Onii-chan?

14:22.790 --> 14:23.850
No!

14:24.630 --> 14:28.620
Mom! My panties and sock are missing!

14:28.620 --> 14:30.890
Oh, dear. I wonder what happened to them.

14:30.890 --> 14:32.170
How strange.

14:32.170 --> 14:34.800
Where did they go?!

14:33.380 --> 14:36.020
<i>People's minds aren't reliable at all.</i>

14:41.480 --> 14:43.960
What's that? A manuscript?

14:47.110 --> 14:48.330
Maa-kun?

14:48.330 --> 14:49.620
I'm gonna go out for a bit.

14:50.260 --> 14:52.070
But it's almost time for dinner.

14:54.040 --> 14:56.910
Ah! Aki-sama's so cute here!

14:56.910 --> 15:01.440
This lovely Aki-sama, this cute Aki-sama,

15:01.440 --> 15:03.920
and this noble Aki-sama! Give them all to me!

15:03.920 --> 15:07.120
Basically, give me all the Aki-samas!

15:07.120 --> 15:09.640
I guess you really did go to Paris.

15:09.640 --> 15:14.430
We went to the Eiffel Tower, 
the Louvre Museum, and Mont-Saint-Michel.

15:14.430 --> 15:18.220
That was pretty rough. 
It was pretty far from Paris, too.

15:18.220 --> 15:22.320
Aw, no fair. When I had my trip, 
it was just to New York.

15:22.320 --> 15:25.400
At least you were in a place 
where people understand English.

15:25.400 --> 15:29.100
I cant even speak English, 
so what am I going to do next year?

15:29.100 --> 15:33.530
But, hey... These are all group pictures.

15:33.530 --> 15:35.740
Where are the pictures of 
Aki-sama during her free time?

15:35.740 --> 15:38.730
I don't actually have any, sorry.

15:38.730 --> 15:42.170
Hey, hang on a sec! 
How worthless are you as a photographer?

15:42.170 --> 15:44.270
Did your battery die at the 
critical moment or what?

15:44.270 --> 15:45.760
You're useless.

15:45.760 --> 15:50.340
That's not it. Aki-chan hung out 
with Makabe-kun, not me.

15:50.340 --> 15:52.200
What?!

15:52.200 --> 15:53.970
Aki-sama, is that true?

15:54.800 --> 15:56.810
I didn't notice at all!

15:56.810 --> 16:00.140
<i>Sumire... Just a little longer.</i>

16:01.390 --> 16:04.350
Paris

16:01.390 --> 16:04.350
New York

16:01.390 --> 16:04.350
Cebu

16:01.390 --> 16:04.350
Taipei

16:01.390 --> 16:04.350
Honolulu

16:01.390 --> 16:04.350
Los Angeles

16:01.390 --> 16:04.350
Hong Kong

16:01.390 --> 16:04.350
Taipei

16:01.390 --> 16:04.350
London

16:01.990 --> 16:04.350
What?! Sumire collapsed?!

16:04.350 --> 16:08.730
No... I need to know more. How is she doing?

16:08.730 --> 16:13.450
<i>They acted quickly, 
so she's stable now, at least...</i>

16:13.790 --> 16:15.520
<i>How many times has it been now?</i>

16:15.520 --> 16:19.450
<i>The fee to keep her in a private 
room is already so high...</i>

16:19.450 --> 16:22.570
We don't need a fancy private room!
A shared room would be fine!

16:22.570 --> 16:24.490
Getting Sumire better should come first!

16:24.490 --> 16:27.290
<i>We couldn't possibly blemish 
the Gasou name in such a manner!</i>

16:31.440 --> 16:33.450
<i>The only one who needs to be tied down</i>

16:33.450 --> 16:37.290
<i>by conventions, traditions, 
and the Gasou name is me.</i>

16:37.290 --> 16:40.600
<i>There's no way I can let Sumire 
go through the same thing.</i>

16:41.080 --> 16:43.520
<i>I don't know what happened in Paris,</i>

16:42.530 --> 16:45.930
We need to know more details.

16:43.520 --> 16:47.220
<i>but I can't let her develop any 
affection toward Makabe.</i>

16:47.750 --> 16:49.820
Are you listening, Gasou?!

16:49.820 --> 16:50.990
Huh? What?

16:50.990 --> 16:53.870
I held back because you were there!

16:53.870 --> 16:55.050
Whoops, sorry.

16:55.050 --> 16:58.630
Ugh! Aki-sama, are you cheating on us?!

16:58.630 --> 17:02.520
You have all of us and yet you 
went to France to go on a date?

17:02.520 --> 17:04.640
Wait, maybe he threatened her.

17:04.640 --> 17:06.410
What?! He won't get away with that!

17:06.410 --> 17:07.670
Absolutely unacceptable!

17:07.670 --> 17:10.020
Could we not talk about that?!

17:13.480 --> 17:14.840
Aki-chan.

17:14.840 --> 17:19.020
If you really feel that way, 
stop hanging around Makabe.

17:19.020 --> 17:22.560
Could you give me a little 
more thought instead?

17:27.570 --> 17:29.880
I'm going to go wash my hands.

17:36.650 --> 17:38.030
Hey, you!

17:38.030 --> 17:40.410
You're getting way too cozy with her!

17:40.410 --> 17:43.480
You promised you wouldn't pursue her.

17:43.480 --> 17:48.080
I-I know, but I couldn't keep quiet 
anymore after what I saw.

17:48.080 --> 17:49.640
The hell are you talking about?!

17:49.640 --> 17:53.000
Look. This is why Aki-chan changed.

17:54.350 --> 17:57.340
Makabe Masamune and Koiwai Yoshino?!

17:57.340 --> 18:01.930
Aki-chan's hurt. She was 
betrayed by someone she trusts.

18:01.930 --> 18:07.480
That's why I thought it might be better 
to force her to notice someone else.

18:07.480 --> 18:08.560
I see...

18:09.040 --> 18:12.860
<i>Even though this is all a lie, 
I win if I can get her to believe it.</i>

18:18.670 --> 18:19.670
Excuse me.

18:21.250 --> 18:25.940
I'm sorry, but aren't you the little boy 
who used to be friends with Aki-sama?

18:25.940 --> 18:27.800
Huh? Um...

18:27.800 --> 18:32.380
I knew right away! You look exactly the same!

18:32.380 --> 18:34.340
<b>gaki Group</b>

18:32.380 --> 18:34.340
<b>Secretary</b>

18:32.730 --> 18:36.090
I'm the secretary to the head 
of the Adagaki family.

18:36.090 --> 18:37.980
My name is Yuisaki.

18:37.980 --> 18:39.320
Adagaki...

18:41.010 --> 18:43.300
I'm so glad you remember me!

18:45.700 --> 18:48.750
Where is it? I know it's here somewhere...

18:48.750 --> 18:53.960
Kanetsugu-sama. You haven't even 
changed. What are you doing here?

18:53.960 --> 18:54.980
There it is!

18:54.980 --> 18:57.740
What is the meaning of this, Kanetsugu-sama?

18:57.740 --> 18:59.260
The written oath.

18:59.260 --> 19:01.680
The one Grandfather made with 
the previous Adagaki family head

19:01.680 --> 19:04.200
when he was still in his prime.

19:04.450 --> 19:07.900
I didn't think a single piece of 
paper would do much good,

19:07.900 --> 19:10.030
but if I work this into 
everything I heard today,

19:10.030 --> 19:12.540
I'll be able to suck the 
Adagaki family funds dry!

19:12.940 --> 19:17.190
I'm going to go marry into their family!

19:18.880 --> 19:19.870
Aki-sama...

19:19.870 --> 19:20.970
Are you okay?

19:21.340 --> 19:22.300
Yes.

19:22.840 --> 19:23.900
Aki-chan...

19:24.730 --> 19:28.090
I'm sorry I suddenly lashed out.

19:28.090 --> 19:31.980
It's okay. You don't have to tell me 
what happened if you don't want to,

19:31.980 --> 19:35.610
but if you ever need to talk, 
I'll be there for you.

19:36.750 --> 19:38.990
I'm on your side, Aki-chan.

19:38.990 --> 19:45.370
I have no intention of rushing. I'll be 
waiting until you're ready, of course.

19:46.050 --> 19:48.100
I'll wait forever for you.

20:19.040 --> 20:20.280
Pig's Foot.

20:20.970 --> 20:23.100
Aki-sama's not here right now.

20:23.100 --> 20:25.450
She had a date with Kanetsugu today.

20:25.450 --> 20:28.490
No, it's fine. That doesn't really matter.

20:29.720 --> 20:31.530
I haven't been here in forever.

20:31.530 --> 20:34.210
This courtyard's much 
smaller than I remembered.

20:34.760 --> 20:37.800
It's definitely bigger than mine, though.

20:37.800 --> 20:39.170
Pig's Foot...

20:39.480 --> 20:42.500
It felt like it continued 
to the ends of the earth...

20:44.590 --> 20:46.520
But it didn't, of course.

20:47.550 --> 20:53.320
Back in Paris, she had the nerve to act like 
she didn't know my Pig's Foot nickname.

20:53.710 --> 20:57.690
Even though she's the one who 
called me that when the bullies

20:57.690 --> 20:59.520
were beating the crap out of me here.

20:59.520 --> 21:01.100
That pissed me off.

21:01.100 --> 21:03.830
There was no way I was going 
to let her get away with that.

21:04.250 --> 21:07.990
But... What if there's a chance 
she's telling the truth?

21:09.450 --> 21:12.190
Thinking that made me feel a little uneasy.

21:12.190 --> 21:17.030
Was the voice I heard here 
really Adagaki Aki's?

21:17.500 --> 21:20.420
I don't follow. What are you getting at?

21:20.800 --> 21:24.890
Back then, I thought the only 
child in this house was her.

21:25.380 --> 21:28.340
That's why I never even 
considered it could be someone else.

21:31.310 --> 21:37.030
According to her, there was another child 
her age at this mansion back then,

21:37.420 --> 21:40.150
who couldn't leave her room
because she had chickenpox.

21:42.330 --> 21:45.960
And... that she was 
watching us that whole time.

21:47.240 --> 21:53.330
The only ones who know the nickname of 
Pig's Foot are me, those bullies, and...

21:53.830 --> 21:56.540
the one who gave me that nickname.

21:56.540 --> 22:00.330
But... Adagaki Aki didn't remember it.

22:00.810 --> 22:02.500
So then...

22:03.720 --> 22:06.130
Why do you call me Pig's Foot?
